<section class="page-hero">
  <span class="section-tag">Consultants &amp; Coaches</span>
  <h1>Look Professional. <span class="gradient-text">Close More Deals.</span></h1>
  <p>Your expertise is your product. Your website, proposals, and client experience should reflect that expertise at every touchpoint. We help consultants and coaches build credibility and scale their practice.</p>
  <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started &#8594;</a>
</section>

<!-- Authority Building -->
<section class="container">
  <div class="authority-box fade-in">
    <span class="auth-tag">The Credibility System</span>
    <h3>Everything That Positions You as the Expert</h3>
    <p class="desc">A clunky website, messy proposals, or awkward payment process undermines the premium positioning you have worked to build. We make sure every touchpoint reinforces your authority.</p>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <h4>Professional Website</h4>
        <p>Custom design that positions you as the authority. Case studies, testimonials, and clear service offerings that convert visitors into discovery calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h4>Content Marketing</h4>
        <p>Blog posts and thought leadership pieces optimized for search. Demonstrate expertise, attract organic traffic, and build trust before the first conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h4>Polished Proposals</h4>
        <p>Beautiful, interactive proposals with open tracking, e-signatures, and built-in payment collection. Go from pitch to paid without friction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h4>Client Experience</h4>
        <p>Seamless scheduling, secure portals for sharing deliverables, automated invoicing, and professional communication at every stage.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Industry Problems -->
<section class="problems-section">
