        <div class="problem-icon">&#128683;</div>
        <h3>Credibility Gap</h3>
        <p>You have deep expertise, but your website looks like it was built in 2015. Potential clients Google you before the discovery call, and a weak online presence undermines your value before you even speak.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card fade-in">
        <div class="problem-icon">&#128338;</div>
        <h3>Admin Time Drain</h3>
        <p>Scheduling calls, writing proposals, chasing invoices, managing client communication — the business side of consulting eats into the hours you should be spending on billable client work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card fade-in">
        <div class="problem-icon">&#128200;</div>
        <h3>Feast or Famine Pipeline</h3>
        <p>When you are busy with client work, marketing stops. When projects end, you scramble for the next one. Without a consistent lead generation system, revenue is unpredictable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Solutions -->
